# Game data. NEVER commit these.
#
# The DOOM *source* is GPL-2.0 and is what this repository is. The WAD files
# are not: they are the commercial game, still sold, and being widely
# available is not the same as being free to redistribute. A port ships
# without one and tells you to bring your own - which is what every other DOOM
# port has done for twenty-five years.
#
# Keep the WAD next to the built binary, on the disk image, on the USB stick.
# Not here.
*.WAD
*.wad
*.LMP
*.lmp
*.DEH
*.deh

# The original DOS executables and their support files, if they ever get
# copied into this tree by accident. Same reason.
DOOM.EXE
DOOM*.EXE
DM.EXE
*.CFG

# Build output
*.EXE
*.o
*.a
build/

# Saved games and configuration the game writes next to itself
doomsav*.dsg
default.cfg

# Editor and OS leftovers
*.swp
*~
.DS_Store
